#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Desktop Shell
#  File: sovereign_desktop_shell.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS desktop shell responsible for:
#      • workspace management
#      • wallpaper engine
#      • dock & panel orchestration
#      • window manager integration
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Workspaces](ca://s?q=Explain_SovereignOS_Workspaces)
#    - [Panels](ca://s?q=Explain_SovereignOS_Panels)
#    - [Dock](ca://s?q=Explain_SovereignOS_Dock)
#    - [Wallpaper Engine](ca://s?q=Explain_SovereignOS_Wallpaper_Engine)
#    - [Shell Snapshot](ca://s?q=Explain_SovereignOS_Shell_Snapshot)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - set_wallpaper(color_or_path)
#         Sets desktop wallpaper.
#
#    - register_panel(name, config)
#         Registers a top/bottom/side panel.
#
#    - dock_add(app_id)
#         Adds an app to the dock.
#
#    - dock_remove(app_id)
#         Removes an app from the dock.
#
#    - create_workspace(index)
#         Creates a new workspace.
#
#    - switch_workspace(index)
#         Switches active workspace.
#
#    - open_window(title, x, y, w, h)
#         Opens a window in the active workspace.
#
#    - close_window(wid)
#         Closes a window.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns full desktop shell state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  DESKTOP SHELL STRUCTURE:
#
#    {
#      "active_workspace": 1,
#      "workspaces": { 1: ["WIN-..."], 2: [] },
#      "wallpaper": "#000000",
#      "panels": { "top": {...}, "bottom": {...} },
#      "dock": ["app.browser", "app.terminal"]
#    }
#
